# a format 27 project and presets format 16, from before the one effects list's track slots (format 28: the character
# and the insert become slots 1 and 2 of the catalog): saved by that build, for the migration's test
# (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy). Track 3 knit with a drive character and a chorus insert (its mix 90, locked to 40 on
# step 1; its character locked to fold on step 2), track 4 a ring character and a rumble, track 5 a phaser, track 6
# an echo (its time locked to 1/8 on step 1), track 7 a juno; the kit (track 1) a crush character and a tremolo.
# User presets U1 (track 3) and U2 (track 7), user kit K1 (track 1).
# Run by a format 27 build (5cb0293): its loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v27.xy
wait 300
listen
bpm 112
param 3 engine 0
param 3 ctype 1
param 3 camt 90
param 3 ctone 40
param 3 cmix 100
param 3 itype 6
param 3 i1 30
param 3 i2 70
param 3 i3 90
lock 3 1 1 i3 40
lock 3 1 2 ctype 2
param 4 engine 0
param 4 ctype 4
param 4 camt 50
param 4 ctone 30
param 4 itype 9
param 4 i1 60
param 4 i2 70
param 4 i3 80
param 5 engine 0
param 5 itype 2
param 5 i1 20
param 5 i2 90
param 5 i3 60
param 6 engine 0
param 6 itype 7
param 6 i1 6
param 6 i2 95
param 6 i3 70
lock 6 1 1 i1 5
param 7 engine 0
param 7 itype 8
param 7 i1 1
param 7 i2 100
param 7 i3 60
param 1 ctype 3
param 1 camt 80
param 1 ctone 20
param 1 itype 1
param 1 i2 100
wait 40
tap EDIT
tap SEL
row SAVE KIT
wait 300
tap SEL
wait 40
said KIT SAVED
usersave 3 1
usersave 7 2
projsave 1 v27_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v27.bin
